WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Soft interface ambience]
Two Codex accounts. One shared Codex home. Chaos.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Introducing Open Profile Manager: every Codex account, cleanly separated.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Three named profiles are added with separate local state.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.500
Read-only quota status is shown for every profile. Selection stays explicit.

00:19.500 --> 00:23.500
The Work profile launches the real Codex process in the terminal.

00:23.500 --> 00:28.500
The same profiles are available in the native macOS app, in English and Portuguese.

00:28.500 --> 00:32.500
Local-first. Notarized. No telemetry. Open source under the MIT license.

00:32.500 --> 00:38.000
Open Profile Manager is available at github.com/mneves75/open-profile-manager.
